WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:03.270
Diary management puts the shared plan into practice Diary

00:00:03.297 --> 00:00:06.481
management is more than finding an empty calendar slot

00:00:07.442 --> 00:00:11.415
The executive may need preparation time a decision-ready pack

00:00:11.797 --> 00:00:15.849
travel time and contributions from other people A new

00:00:15.928 --> 00:00:18.863
appointment must be checked against those commitments and the

00:00:18.942 --> 00:00:23.481
purpose they serve In the fictional Meridian case Lindiwe

00:00:23.507 --> 00:00:27.099
needs time to prepare for a service-investment decision meeting

00:00:28.007 --> 00:00:34.152
Daniel her executive assistant EA coordinates the plan Finance

00:00:34.178 --> 00:00:39.113
and operations supply papers Thandi the executive protection officer

00:00:39.323 --> 00:00:43.757
EPO provides protective input within her mandate and Aisha

00:00:43.770 --> 00:00:46.534
may provide cover only for work she has accepted

00:00:47.481 --> 00:00:51.757
You will use this connected plan throughout LU1 First

00:00:51.757 --> 00:00:55.310
you will distinguish known facts from assumptions then prepare

00:00:55.376 --> 00:00:59.784
the executive support brief T1 . 1 examine authority

00:00:59.823 --> 00:01:03.784
and diary conflicts recommend workable options and develop a

00:01:03.836 --> 00:01:08.376
working agreement Each new task uses information or a

00:01:08.455 --> 00:01:10.547
work product from the preceding learning
